%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
flowchart TD
    A[Push to main] --> B{Run Tests}
    B -->|Pass| C[Build Docker Image]
    B -->|Fail| Z[Notify Developer]

    C --> D[Push to Registry]
    D --> E{Security Scan}
    E -->|Clean| F[Deploy to Staging]
    E -->|Vulnerabilities Found| Z

    F --> G{Run Smoke Tests}
    G -->|Pass| H[Manual Approval Gate]
    G -->|Fail| I[Rollback Staging]
    I --> Z

    H -->|Approved| J[Deploy to Production]
    H -->|Rejected| K[Back to Development]
    K --> Z

    J --> L{Health Check}
    L -->|Healthy| M[Route Traffic]
    L -->|Unhealthy| N[Rollback Production]
    N --> Z

    M --> O[Monitor for 15 min]
    O --> P{Error Rate OK?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Done - Deployment Complete]
    P -->|No| N

    style A fill:#4A90D9,color:white
    style Q fill:#27AE60,color:white
    style Z fill:#E74C3C,color:white
    style H fill:#F39C12,color:white
